          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>The flat bed design allows your dog to fully stretch out in their instinctual sleeping position, promoting comfortable rest and minimising joint pressure. It’s perfect as a beautifully simple standalone bed or can be easily fitted for crates, providing versatility for you and your dog's needs.</p>",
            "size": 100
