    "tabs": {
      "type": "section-accordions",
      "blocks": {
        "acordion-0": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Is marble safe for dogs?",
            "text": "<p>Natural marble stone is safe for dog use. It is non-toxic and non-porous, which helps reduce bacterial growth.</p>"
          }
        },
        "acordion-1": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Where is the marble from?",
            "text": "<p>New York Marble, or sometimes referred to as Milas Lilac Marble, is sourced from the Milas region in southern coastal Turkey near Bodrum. Known for its white background and distinctive lilac hues and purple veining, this marble is a premium choice for high-end interiors and design.</p>"
          }
        },
        "acordion-2": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "title": "What is Included in the Set?",
            "text": "<p>Two generously sized marble bowls and a large marble tray</p>"
          }
        },
        "text_XbxMVH": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "title": "What is the capacity of each bowl?",
            "text": "<p>Each bowl has a 900ML capacity, which is suitable for both small and large dogs and cats.</p>"
          }
        },
        "text_j6QQfm": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "title": "How do I clean the marble bowls?",
            "text": "<p>As the bowl set is 100% natural marble, we recommend hand wash with warm water and mild detergent. With a smooth surface, it wipes away dirt and cleans easily.</p><p>Clean the tray with mild spray and wipe.</p>"
          }
        },
        "d0defd0d-94c3-403c-bd36-dc2f140a104f": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Warranty and Returns",
            "text": "<p><strong>Returns</strong><br/>The New York Marble Bowl Set is a limited edition piece and sale is final. It cannot be returned for change of mind.<br/><br/><strong>Warranty<br/></strong>Warranty is offered for manufacturing defects including faulty workmanship or materials. This warranty does not cover normal wear and tear or damages caused by the customer or by dog use, such as excessive scratching, biting, accidents, chewing, or other use.</p><p>For warranty issues, please contact us within 48 hours of opening the bed at <a>hello@koozipets.com.au</a>, including images of the defective or damaged item. Failure to provide this information within the specified timeframe may void your exchange or refund.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
